WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:07.850
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:08.120 --> 02:08.919
Korean?

3
02:09.240 --> 02:10.120
Chinese.

4
02:11.240 --> 02:12.360
Then, Chinese,

5
02:12.360 --> 02:14.479
can you buy me a drink?

6
02:27.759 --> 02:28.759
Mister Chinese.

7
02:31.360 --> 02:33.639
Take it easy. I want to ask you something first.

8
02:34.639 --> 02:35.719
Are you a cop?

9
02:35.800 --> 02:36.680
Of course not.

10
02:38.199 --> 02:40.919
Do you know these two in the photo?

11
02:42.120 --> 02:43.680
You don't want to mess with these people.

12
02:44.039 --> 02:45.520
You'd better stay away from them.

13
02:46.039 --> 02:47.240
I think you misunderstand.

14
02:47.520 --> 02:49.879
I'm looking to buy some goods from them.

15
02:50.479 --> 02:51.360
You know what I mean?

16
02:53.400 --> 02:55.879
Sorry, I don't know them.

17
03:01.599 --> 03:02.560
Just say the word,

18
03:02.879 --> 03:04.240
and all this money is yours.

19
03:22.560 --> 03:23.240
Hello, sir.

20
03:23.360 --> 03:25.159
How may I help you?

21
03:28.199 --> 03:28.840
I was wondering,

22
03:28.840 --> 03:30.960
is your boss named Qin Mu?

23
03:31.319 --> 03:33.039
Yes, but he's not here.

24
03:34.159 --> 03:35.400
When will he be back?

25
03:36.199 --> 03:37.719
He's been away on business recently.

26
03:37.919 --> 03:39.800
None of us have seen him either.

27
03:40.080 --> 03:41.639
May I ask what this is regarding?

28
03:44.039 --> 03:44.879
How about this?

29
03:45.199 --> 03:46.280
Leave me your number,

30
03:46.560 --> 03:47.400
and when he gets back,

31
03:47.560 --> 03:49.400
I'll have him call you. How does that sound?

32
03:49.560 --> 03:50.360
No, that's not necessary.

33
03:50.800 --> 03:51.919
I'll come back later.

34
03:52.199 --> 03:54.080
All right, thank you very much.

35
04:01.599 --> 04:02.360
Thank you.

36
04:02.639 --> 04:04.479
I never told you anything.

37
04:51.600 --> 04:52.480
Where is Tian Xin?

38
04:54.319 --> 04:58.279
Kill me, and you'll never see her again.

39
05:12.639 --> 05:13.480
Talk!

40
05:22.920 --> 05:23.399
Freeze!

41
05:24.040 --> 05:24.680
Don't move!

42
05:25.519 --> 05:27.079
What are you doing? Nobody move!

43
05:27.680 --> 05:29.399
Stop right now, or I'll shoot!

44
05:37.519 --> 05:39.879
Don't run, or I'll shoot!

45
05:41.439 --> 05:43.040
You, put your hands up!

46
06:56.879 --> 06:57.720
Hungry, aren't you?

47
07:01.680 --> 07:03.439
Do you really think you can hold me captive forever?

48
07:05.279 --> 07:06.680
I've already found Qin Mu.

49
07:07.319 --> 07:08.800
I'll see my brother soon.

50
07:08.959 --> 07:10.040
Once I meet up with him,

51
07:10.519 --> 07:12.600
you won't have to suffer through hard times with me anymore.

52
07:13.360 --> 07:14.920
You still don't understand, do you?

53
07:16.759 --> 07:18.000
No matter what you do,

54
07:18.160 --> 07:19.560
I will never be with you.

55
07:20.279 --> 07:20.959
I know.

56
07:21.240 --> 07:22.879
For someone like you, in my heart,

57
07:23.879 --> 07:25.480
there's only hatred, nothing else.

58
07:26.519 --> 07:27.120
I know.

59
07:28.279 --> 07:29.319
I never expected you to love me.

60
07:30.759 --> 07:32.160
As long as you're by my side,

61
07:32.879 --> 07:34.279
that's all I need.

62
07:36.800 --> 07:38.079
Come on, have some food.

63
07:42.560 --> 07:43.079
Come on.

64
07:44.560 --> 07:45.160
Take it.

65
07:47.519 --> 07:49.680
Do you have any idea how selfish you're being?

66
07:50.000 --> 07:51.199
Something that everyone else understands...

67
07:51.360 --> 07:52.519
Why can't you get it through your head?

68
07:57.279 --> 07:58.600
I really don't.

69
08:01.639 --> 08:03.279
I understand that you hate me.

70
08:04.319 --> 08:05.360
After all, I'm not a cop.

71
08:05.519 --> 08:06.680
I'm a drug dealer.

72
08:07.040 --> 08:08.680
If fate gave me another chance,

73
08:08.839 --> 08:10.000
I would definitely choose to be a good person.

74
08:10.199 --> 08:12.040
To be the kind of person you'd like.

75
08:12.639 --> 08:15.600
Too bad I can't turn back time.

76
08:20.480 --> 08:21.920
In everyone's eyes,

77
08:22.399 --> 08:24.600
I'm just a vile, unforgivable villain.

78
08:29.759 --> 08:30.720
As long as you're here,

79
08:31.519 --> 08:34.080
a piece of beauty remains in my life.

80
08:34.679 --> 08:37.159
I'd rather fight the entire world

81
08:38.159 --> 08:40.080
than stand by and watch

82
08:41.200 --> 08:43.559
that beauty get ripped away by someone else.

83
08:52.320 --> 08:53.840
If you won't let me go,

84
08:55.240 --> 08:56.679
I'll die right in front of you.

85
08:57.279 --> 08:58.480
Dying is easy.

86
08:59.440 --> 09:02.200
Have you considered your cop boyfriend, though?

87
09:04.279 --> 09:05.399
Back in Nanhai,

88
09:05.399 --> 09:07.039
we really didn't have a chance to strike.

89
09:07.919 --> 09:09.720
But now he's come here.

90
09:09.919 --> 09:11.600
As soon as I see my brother,

91
09:12.200 --> 09:15.519
his life will be in our hands.

92
09:20.519 --> 09:21.399
What did you say?

93
09:23.399 --> 09:24.799
Li Xiao came to Country M?

94
09:26.759 --> 09:27.960
Have you seen him?

95
09:28.840 --> 09:30.600
Where is he?

96
09:30.679 --> 09:31.440
I have to go find him.

97
09:32.600 --> 09:35.080
Let go of me! He came here for me!

98
09:35.159 --> 09:35.919
Let go of me!

99
09:36.200 --> 09:37.320
If you dare take half a step out of this room,

100
09:38.600 --> 09:40.600
I'll make sure he dies a miserable death.

101
09:53.440 --> 09:55.360
I'll go get you something more to eat.

102
09:56.799 --> 09:58.759
You can scream for help or try to run.

103
09:58.840 --> 09:59.559
It's up to you.

104
10:01.120 --> 10:02.440
But let me remind you,

105
10:03.600 --> 10:06.120
I can take Li Xiao down with me at any moment.

106
10:38.519 --> 10:40.080
Chinese, you can go.

107
11:23.720 --> 11:25.960
What on earth happened last night?

108
11:28.960 --> 11:30.519
I saw Li Qiang last night.

109
11:32.279 --> 11:33.559
Li Qiang is in Country M.

110
11:34.840 --> 11:36.000
I went to Qin Mu's bar

111
11:37.240 --> 11:38.279
to investigate Professor Du's case.

112
11:38.480 --> 11:40.159
I didn't expect to turn around and see him.

113
11:41.279 --> 11:42.759
Unfortunately, he got away.

114
11:45.600 --> 11:47.200
When Ma Jingrong left Country M,

115
11:47.360 --> 11:49.200
he specifically instructed Qin Mu to assist Li Qiang.

116
11:49.840 --> 11:51.440
We have an inside man close to Qin Mu.

117
11:51.759 --> 11:54.000
As soon as Li Qiang meets up with Qin Mu,

118
11:54.039 --> 11:55.600
we'll immediately notify Country M's police

119
11:55.759 --> 11:56.799
to make the arrest and rescue Tian Xin.

120
11:56.840 --> 11:58.519
Everything was under our control.

121
11:58.759 --> 11:59.600
You were so reckless.

122
11:59.759 --> 12:01.240
You could easily spook him, you know?

123
12:02.120 --> 12:04.320
Li Qiang will definitely go back to Qin Mu's bar.

124
12:05.000 --> 12:08.519
I want you to post people to stake out the bar.

125
12:10.559 --> 12:12.559
As Interpol officers in Country M,

126
12:12.720 --> 12:13.759
we have no law enforcement authority.

127
12:15.919 --> 12:17.639
Then have Country M's police send people!

128
12:18.399 --> 12:19.200
We can't just wait around here

129
12:19.399 --> 12:20.200
and do nothing, right?

130
12:21.559 --> 12:22.080
Get in the car.

131
12:32.799 --> 12:34.399
We still can't be sure

132
12:34.600 --> 12:35.559
whether anyone in Country M's police

133
12:35.720 --> 12:37.000
is actually working for Theerade.

134
12:37.200 --> 12:38.960
If Theerade finds out Country M's police

135
12:39.159 --> 12:40.519
are already targeting Qin Mu,

136
12:41.080 --> 12:42.159
he's bound to get suspicious.

137
12:42.279 --> 12:43.639
We can't let this one thing

138
12:43.720 --> 12:44.759
jeopardize the entire operation!

139
12:44.919 --> 12:46.000
I'm asking you to be patient.

140
12:47.679 --> 12:49.320
Tian Xin is in Li Qiang's hands right now!

141
12:50.039 --> 12:51.120
How can I be patient?!

142
12:51.440 --> 12:52.240
What is she to you?

143
12:55.240 --> 12:56.360
She's my woman.

144
13:06.840 --> 13:09.279
No wonder you said last time that Li Qiang kidnapped Tian Xin

145
13:09.519 --> 13:10.480
just to get revenge on you.

146
13:11.799 --> 13:13.440
But have you considered one thing?

147
13:14.080 --> 13:16.080
If you care about Tian Xin's safety,

148
13:16.279 --> 13:17.120
you ought to understand

149
13:17.720 --> 13:19.120
that without a foolproof plan,

150
13:19.279 --> 13:20.240
not only will you fail to save her,

151
13:20.240 --> 13:21.559
you'll actually end up getting her killed.

152
13:28.120 --> 13:30.159
How is the situation with Professor Du?

153
13:34.759 --> 13:36.399
The criminals holding Professor Du hostage

154
13:36.759 --> 13:38.080
are staying in Golden Harbor Fishing Village.

155
13:38.720 --> 13:39.360
Once we track them down,

156
13:39.559 --> 13:41.080
we should be able to find Professor Du.

157
13:44.440 --> 13:45.519
That'd be great.

158
13:45.679 --> 13:47.080
As long as we catch those two thugs,

159
13:47.080 --> 13:48.399
we'll have the grounds and leverage

160
13:48.759 --> 13:50.879
to have Country M's police work with ours

161
13:51.080 --> 13:52.519
and launch a joint operation, right?

162
13:53.279 --> 13:53.639
Look,

163
13:54.600 --> 13:56.120
we have our own insider

164
13:56.279 --> 13:57.919
close to Qin Mu, right?

165
13:58.080 --> 13:59.840
We'll definitely get word right away

166
13:59.960 --> 14:01.200
on Li Qiang and Tian Xin.

167
14:01.720 --> 14:02.919
Just be patient, okay?

168
14:07.320 --> 14:10.240
I'm joining the Golden Harbor operation too.

169
14:13.919 --> 14:15.039
Look, about that...

170
14:15.240 --> 14:16.200
I'll do my best to coordinate it.

171
14:16.600 --> 14:17.559
But standard protocol dictates that

172
14:17.919 --> 14:19.639
without top-level authorization,

173
14:20.080 --> 14:21.519
you can only be present

174
14:21.519 --> 14:22.799
when Country M's police make the arrest.

175
14:22.919 --> 14:23.840
You cannot engage in the operation,

176
14:24.080 --> 14:25.679
let alone carry a firearm, all right?

177
14:26.000 --> 14:27.120
I understand all that.

178
14:27.279 --> 14:29.080
But right now, our compatriot's life is on the line,

179
14:29.279 --> 14:30.480
not some international protocol.

180
15:32.399 --> 15:33.919
Once we capture Ayutai and Shaba,

181
15:34.399 --> 15:35.399
we can confirm

182
15:35.960 --> 15:38.720
whether Professor Du Guangming is in Piyazi's hands.

183
15:40.200 --> 15:41.279
When that time comes,

184
15:41.480 --> 15:42.679
we at Interpol

185
15:42.879 --> 15:44.879
will urge Country M's police to launch a rescue.

186
15:48.679 --> 15:50.879
I'm just afraid that by the time the rescue begins,

187
15:51.039 --> 15:52.000
it'll already be too late.

188
15:52.799 --> 15:54.039
I know you're anxious,

189
15:54.240 --> 15:55.519
but we are in Country M.

190
15:59.639 --> 16:03.279
Although Country M's police

191
16:03.399 --> 16:05.200
have agreed with Chinese police

192
16:05.399 --> 16:06.720
on a joint operation,

193
16:06.879 --> 16:09.960
without solid evidence

194
16:10.120 --> 16:12.720
against Piyazi and Theerade,

195
16:13.159 --> 16:16.399
and before locating their drug base,

196
16:16.600 --> 16:22.320
we can't authorize you to join the arrest

197
16:22.840 --> 16:24.320
and interrogation operations.

198
16:28.879 --> 16:32.240
I see. I understand your position.

199
16:32.480 --> 16:33.559
But the problem right now is

200
16:33.720 --> 16:34.600
that our fellow Chinese citizen

201
16:34.759 --> 16:36.600
faces a threat to his life in Country M.

202
16:36.759 --> 16:37.720
As a Chinese police officer,

203
16:37.879 --> 16:39.159
I can't just stand by and watch.

204
16:39.360 --> 16:40.480
I hope you can understand that.

205
16:44.320 --> 16:47.120
I can approve you joining the team

206
16:47.679 --> 16:49.879
at the scene,

207
16:50.440 --> 16:52.120
but you cannot carry a firearm

208
16:52.720 --> 16:55.000
or participate in the actual raid.

209
16:59.879 --> 17:00.480
Fine.

210
17:02.879 --> 17:04.559
Then if you do capture

211
17:04.680 --> 17:05.480
those two criminals,

212
17:05.559 --> 17:07.079
how quickly do you think

213
17:07.279 --> 17:08.759
you can get intel on Professor Du?

214
17:08.839 --> 17:10.000
And another question:

215
17:10.160 --> 17:11.480
If the suspects refuse to cooperate,

216
17:11.640 --> 17:12.359
what solutions

217
17:12.359 --> 17:13.319
would you have then?

218
17:14.519 --> 17:15.640
As a fellow officer,

219
17:15.839 --> 17:18.279
Officer Li, you should know well

220
17:18.440 --> 17:21.519
that we can only do our best.

221
17:21.720 --> 17:22.960
If the suspects refuse to confess,

222
17:23.160 --> 17:25.599
or if the cartel

223
17:26.119 --> 17:28.039
hires lawyers for them,

224
17:28.319 --> 17:32.920
there's little we can do.

225
17:33.079 --> 17:34.200
But let me reiterate:

226
17:34.359 --> 17:36.440
We will certainly do our utmost.

227
17:40.279 --> 17:41.119
All right.

228
17:44.559 --> 17:45.480
Then I have one more question.

229
17:45.640 --> 17:47.519
Once we get information

230
17:47.559 --> 17:48.160
out of the suspects,

231
17:48.160 --> 17:49.799
can we immediately launch a rescue?

232
17:50.759 --> 17:52.599
We first have to determine

233
17:52.960 --> 17:55.480
where Professor Du is held.

234
17:55.759 --> 17:59.000
Only then can we plan the deployment.

235
17:59.759 --> 18:00.480
And before that,

236
18:00.640 --> 18:03.039
we must report everything

237
18:03.240 --> 18:04.720
to the local police department.

238
18:04.920 --> 18:07.400
You must realize how sensitive this case is.

239
18:07.720 --> 18:10.240
We're dealing with a global syndicate,

240
18:10.440 --> 18:11.960
and their operational base

241
18:12.119 --> 18:14.759
is in Jiechan State's lawless territory.

242
18:15.079 --> 18:17.720
Any rescue mission must receive

243
18:18.039 --> 18:22.240
top approval from the national police.

244
18:23.720 --> 18:24.039
But the problem right now is—

245
18:24.039 --> 18:24.720
The problem right now is,

246
18:24.880 --> 18:26.839
Professor Du's life is at risk every second.

247
18:26.920 --> 18:27.759
Yes.

248
18:27.960 --> 18:31.519
He may have already met with foul play.

249
18:32.240 --> 18:34.000
To the questions you asked,

250
18:34.079 --> 18:35.400
no one can give you a definitive answer,

251
18:35.599 --> 18:37.240
and I can only go by the book.

252
19:20.640 --> 19:21.440
Move!

253
20:34.880 --> 20:37.000
Sir, Shaba has escaped.

254
21:09.599 --> 21:11.000
I like the way you do things.

255
21:46.440 --> 21:47.519
In Professor Du's medical records,

256
21:47.680 --> 21:48.960
his allergy history is clearly documented.

257
21:49.839 --> 21:51.319
There's no way he didn't know.

258
21:53.559 --> 21:54.640
You mean Professor Du

259
21:54.799 --> 21:55.960
didn't tell the doctor the truth?

260
21:58.480 --> 21:59.799
He's deliberately trying to die!

261
22:02.000 --> 22:03.079
Professor Du would never tolerate

262
22:03.200 --> 22:05.119
associating with those drug traffickers.

263
22:07.599 --> 22:09.759
Once Piyazi loses patience with him,

264
22:09.920 --> 22:11.240
he could kill him at any moment.

265
22:12.119 --> 22:13.359
We don't have much time left.

266
22:18.039 --> 22:19.000
Piyazi's headquarters

267
22:19.200 --> 22:21.079
is located where multiple borders meet.

268
22:21.920 --> 22:23.079
Due to historical reasons,

269
22:23.240 --> 22:26.079
it's become a lawless tri-border area.

270
22:28.160 --> 22:29.839
Meisuo Town, where Professor Du is held,

271
22:30.000 --> 22:32.640
is within Piyazi's sphere of influence,

272
22:32.640 --> 22:33.880
but it's actually

273
22:33.880 --> 22:35.599
one of your Chinese border towns.

274
22:37.240 --> 22:37.960
All right.

275
22:39.359 --> 22:40.680
Since it's a Chinese town,

276
22:41.559 --> 22:43.240
I'll report to leadership

277
22:43.839 --> 22:45.240
and launch a rescue operation.

278
23:32.359 --> 23:33.079
How is he?

279
23:33.720 --> 23:34.519
Just physical injuries.

280
23:35.319 --> 23:36.079
Nothing too serious.

281
23:37.000 --> 23:40.880
He had complications earlier, though.

282
23:41.240 --> 23:43.440
It will take some time

283
23:43.640 --> 23:44.680
for his body to recover.

284
23:47.559 --> 23:48.559
As long as he's fine.

285
23:50.319 --> 23:52.119
As long as he's fine.

286
23:52.119 --> 23:54.759
Being fine means he's still alive.

287
23:57.039 --> 23:57.839
And being alive is all that matters.

288
24:00.039 --> 24:01.279
Since you're alive,

289
24:02.039 --> 24:03.920
let's talk about

290
24:04.680 --> 24:06.400
topics for the living.

291
24:08.039 --> 24:10.079
Scholars pursue knowledge

292
24:10.559 --> 24:12.200
so their work

293
24:12.400 --> 24:14.000
can be recognized by humanity.

294
24:17.359 --> 24:19.119
It's their greatest honor.

295
24:21.240 --> 24:23.400
I once gave you a platform,

296
24:23.960 --> 24:25.519
yet you didn't appreciate it.

297
24:30.759 --> 24:32.519
You've already died once.

298
24:34.000 --> 24:36.480
Cherish this second chance at life.

299
24:39.799 --> 24:41.000
I want news in three days.

300
24:41.200 --> 24:42.480
Notify me then.

301
24:42.839 --> 24:43.519
Three days?

302
24:44.400 --> 24:45.720
I can't guarantee

303
24:45.960 --> 24:47.960
his body will fully recover by then.

304
24:48.440 --> 24:49.599
You can.

305
24:49.839 --> 24:51.279
What I need is his brain,

306
24:51.480 --> 24:52.440
not his body.

307
24:53.720 --> 24:55.960
Have you thought about moving in with me?

308
24:57.839 --> 24:59.799
A lot of people in town need me.

309
25:00.680 --> 25:02.000
I can't leave with you.

310
25:03.640 --> 25:05.519
I need you more.

311
25:21.359 --> 25:22.720
Have someone guard him.

312
25:23.440 --> 25:25.519
Take him away in three days.

313
25:25.680 --> 25:26.240
Understood.

314
25:26.599 --> 25:28.119
Brother Dong, Four-Legged Snake is back.

315
25:29.559 --> 25:30.400
My brother is back.

316
25:30.920 --> 25:32.359
A-Nan is back, Brother Dong.

317
25:34.839 --> 25:36.440
I only have three days

318
25:36.839 --> 25:38.079
to hurry and treat you.

319
25:39.200 --> 25:40.519
As for the allergic reaction,

320
25:41.759 --> 25:43.039
I don't want it happening again.

321
25:44.279 --> 25:45.400
If you die,

322
25:46.720 --> 25:49.000
my clinic is finished too.

323
25:51.160 --> 25:51.720
Dr. Chen,

324
25:52.720 --> 25:54.400
you know who they are.

325
25:55.440 --> 25:57.359
Why are you still working for them?

326
26:00.440 --> 26:01.839
If I didn't help them,

327
26:02.880 --> 26:04.279
would you even be alive?

328
26:05.119 --> 26:06.519
I'm a doctor.

329
26:07.759 --> 26:09.960
My only job is to treat patients.

330
26:10.759 --> 26:13.599
I don't think about anything else.

331
26:14.279 --> 26:17.240
Many people in town need me.

332
26:17.279 --> 26:18.880
I can't give up on them

333
26:19.839 --> 26:21.000
just because of Piyazi.

334
26:32.440 --> 26:34.480
I'd still advise you to stay alive.

335
26:35.359 --> 26:36.039
As long as you're alive,

336
26:37.839 --> 26:39.279
there's always hope.

337
27:01.319 --> 27:02.400
Regarding your proposal,

338
27:02.799 --> 27:04.240
I briefed the chief.

339
27:04.920 --> 27:05.799
He approved it.

340
27:07.839 --> 27:10.000
After reviewing it, we've decided

341
27:10.799 --> 27:13.440
Capt. Lu will pose as drug lord Shen Xinru

342
27:13.880 --> 27:16.119
and approach Ma Jingrong with you.

343
27:16.759 --> 27:18.880
Also, this is Xia Yang,

344
27:18.880 --> 27:20.759
a drug expert from the Provincial Narcotics Unit.

345
27:20.799 --> 27:22.279
He can use very simple tools

346
27:22.480 --> 27:23.880
to determine drug purity.

347
27:24.279 --> 27:26.240
He will be assisting Captain Lu this time.

348
27:27.240 --> 27:29.960
So where is the real Shen Xinru now?

349
27:31.039 --> 27:32.279
She's already detained in isolation.

350
27:32.680 --> 27:33.279
Don't worry.

351
27:33.599 --> 27:34.599
Before the operation is over,

352
27:34.759 --> 27:36.480
not a single word will leak out.

353
27:38.720 --> 27:41.279
In that case, let's do it.

354
27:44.240 --> 27:44.880
Let's eat.

355
28:26.960 --> 28:28.480
Welcome to Jiechan State.

356
29:28.119 --> 29:29.400
Let them through.

357
29:42.839 --> 29:43.720
Hello, Boss.

358
29:44.480 --> 29:46.599
You're back. Good work.

359
29:47.680 --> 29:49.400
Don't just stand there. Sit down.

360
29:52.680 --> 29:53.799
Why didn't A-Nan come back?

361
29:54.839 --> 29:55.559
Where's my brother?

362
29:56.519 --> 29:59.480
Weren't you supposed to meet in Jiangyang?

363
30:05.119 --> 30:06.160
Nothing to say?

364
30:06.279 --> 30:07.079
Cat got your tongue?

365
30:07.559 --> 30:08.240
Speak up!

366
30:12.200 --> 30:13.000
Something went wrong.

367
30:28.000 --> 30:29.000
Was it the cops?

368
30:30.359 --> 30:32.079
Or did our rivals take him?

369
30:35.480 --> 30:36.079
Speak!

370
30:39.960 --> 30:41.039
Say something!

371
30:44.400 --> 30:45.519
Brother Nan... he...

372
30:50.640 --> 30:51.799
What did you say? I didn't hear you.

373
30:58.039 --> 30:59.839
Brother Nan is dead.

374
31:00.920 --> 31:02.519
Explain yourself right now!

375
31:02.559 --> 31:03.200
Brother Dong...

376
31:03.920 --> 31:04.480
Boss...

377
31:05.119 --> 31:06.680
Brother Dong, this isn't Fourth Brother's fault.

378
31:06.960 --> 31:07.880
Cheng Weimin did it.

379
31:08.000 --> 31:09.279
He teamed up with Qin Mu.

380
31:09.599 --> 31:11.200
Qin Mu hired hitmen for him from Country M.

381
31:11.440 --> 31:13.200
Where's Cheng Weimin? Where is he?

382
31:14.039 --> 31:15.759
When we met Cheng Weimin,

383
31:16.359 --> 31:17.559
the cops ambushed us.

384
31:17.799 --> 31:19.640
Brother Nan shot him dead.

385
31:19.839 --> 31:21.079
What about the hitmen?

386
31:24.400 --> 31:25.440
We didn't see them.

387
31:25.640 --> 31:27.200
But lately, Ma Jingrong

388
31:27.319 --> 31:29.000
has been in close contact with Country M.

389
31:29.319 --> 31:30.640
It's Qin Mu.

390
31:31.200 --> 31:33.319
A few days ago, Qin Mu and his men

391
31:33.519 --> 31:34.720
suddenly left Country M.

392
31:35.319 --> 31:36.039
Brother Nan's death...

393
31:36.240 --> 31:37.920
Qin Mu and his men likely did it.

394
31:40.440 --> 31:41.680
You went out together.

395
31:42.319 --> 31:43.519
You came back alive,

396
31:45.119 --> 31:46.119
but my brother didn't.

397
32:11.359 --> 32:14.160
So many people risk their lives

398
32:14.359 --> 32:16.240
smuggling it inland from Jiechan State,

399
32:17.119 --> 32:19.839
only to sell it off

400
32:19.839 --> 32:20.599
bag by tiny bag.

401
32:21.359 --> 32:24.519
The risk and reward are totally out of proportion.

402
32:25.400 --> 32:29.440
So if we're doing this, let's go all the way.

403
32:30.000 --> 32:34.519
I have sales channels in 13 provinces.

404
32:35.119 --> 32:36.640
No matter how much product you have,

405
32:37.279 --> 32:38.599
I can take it all.

406
32:40.599 --> 32:41.519
However,

407
32:42.880 --> 32:44.759
I need a reliable supplier.

408
32:47.000 --> 32:50.759
As for this Theerade you mentioned,

409
32:51.680 --> 32:52.960
I've never heard of him.

410
32:53.599 --> 32:57.880
I don't know how he measures up

411
32:57.920 --> 32:58.559
against Piyazi.

412
32:59.119 --> 33:03.440
So I'd like to ask you, Mr. Ma,

413
33:04.519 --> 33:06.079
to see if you have what it takes

414
33:07.319 --> 33:08.920
to do business with me.

415
33:09.200 --> 33:13.359
My product is top quality.

416
33:19.839 --> 33:20.519
Mr. Ma,

417
33:22.359 --> 33:23.960
product from Jiechan State

418
33:24.160 --> 33:25.799
is never bad.

419
33:30.279 --> 33:33.440
Yet you can only supply heroin right now.

420
33:34.720 --> 33:37.640
The synthetic drug market is booming,

421
33:37.759 --> 33:40.880
yet you have zero advantage in that area.

422
33:41.400 --> 33:44.279
I've always been pragmatic

423
33:44.559 --> 33:45.599
and straightforward.

424
33:46.559 --> 33:48.599
All I want is a single supplier

425
33:48.839 --> 33:50.680
for a steady, long-term supply.

426
33:51.480 --> 33:52.720
High quality,

427
33:53.519 --> 33:55.440
a diverse selection,

428
33:56.440 --> 34:00.720
and above all, stability and security.

429
34:07.680 --> 34:10.400
New products and No. 4

430
34:11.199 --> 34:13.320
each have their own market demand.

431
34:14.639 --> 34:16.800
Of course, if you're interested, Mr. Shen,

432
34:17.079 --> 34:18.800
we can join forces.

433
34:19.559 --> 34:22.679
I have the manpower and the capital.

434
34:23.199 --> 34:24.760
There's nothing I can't do.

435
34:26.039 --> 34:28.400
If what you say is true, Mr. Ma,

436
34:28.559 --> 34:30.079
nothing would please me more.

437
34:30.960 --> 34:33.719
So I'd like to sign

438
34:34.039 --> 34:36.360
an exclusive contract with Mr. Theerade.

439
34:36.719 --> 34:39.239
Meaning that only I

440
34:39.760 --> 34:42.000
can get product from you.

441
34:43.280 --> 34:44.199
Can you do that?

442
34:45.519 --> 34:46.559
Not a problem.

443
34:51.239 --> 34:52.800
Mr. Ma, oh, Mr. Ma...

444
34:53.760 --> 34:55.119
It's our first meeting.

445
34:56.000 --> 34:58.079
Don't make promises you can't keep.

446
34:59.320 --> 35:01.119
Not that I doubt your capability,

447
35:01.480 --> 35:02.880
but I think

448
35:04.239 --> 35:05.679
for a deal this big,

449
35:06.079 --> 35:07.360
you should head back

450
35:07.519 --> 35:09.360
and discuss it thoroughly with your boss.

451
35:10.039 --> 35:13.039
Besides, I also really want to meet

452
35:13.239 --> 35:14.360
this Mr. Theerade,

453
35:14.679 --> 35:17.239
to talk with him face-to-face.

454
35:18.280 --> 35:21.880
Mr. Theerade never handles

455
35:22.079 --> 35:23.199
business matters in person.

456
35:29.639 --> 35:31.239
If Mr. Theerade can't even show

457
35:32.000 --> 35:33.920
this much sincerity,

458
35:34.239 --> 35:36.119
then I don't think there's any need

459
35:36.119 --> 35:37.679
for us to waste each other's time.

460
35:40.119 --> 35:43.079
Besides, I doubt you're the only ones

461
35:43.440 --> 35:45.320
who can supply product from Jiechan State.

462
35:52.119 --> 35:53.679
In that case, Mr. Shen,

463
35:55.760 --> 35:58.840
I can try to arrange it.

464
36:01.199 --> 36:02.039
Good.

465
36:05.119 --> 36:06.400
I trust you, Mr. Ma.

466
36:07.480 --> 36:10.559
I'll be waiting for your good news.

467
36:11.039 --> 36:11.679
All right.

468
36:33.000 --> 36:34.480
Why didn't you make him stay?

469
36:35.599 --> 36:37.119
I thought he was looking for trouble.

470
36:41.880 --> 36:43.719
You knew Mr. Ma's brother could arrive any minute.

471
36:44.119 --> 36:45.199
Why didn't you give them a heads-up?

472
36:45.519 --> 36:48.559
Boss, I left in such a rush that I forgot.

473
36:49.320 --> 36:50.360
What good are you?

474
36:52.000 --> 36:53.119
Tell me, what can you actually do?

475
36:53.320 --> 36:54.519
You can't even handle something this simple!

476
36:55.199 --> 36:56.880
The man said he'd come back.

477
36:57.639 --> 36:58.639
He seemed to be in a real rush.

478
36:58.800 --> 36:59.960
Probably in the next couple of days.

479
37:05.719 --> 37:06.400
You.

480
37:08.920 --> 37:10.599
Keep an eye out at all times.

481
37:10.760 --> 37:12.719
We need an answer for Mr. Ma when he gets back.

482
37:13.000 --> 37:13.719
Understood, Boss.

483
37:18.760 --> 37:20.880
Boss, this guy insisted on seeing you.

484
37:26.599 --> 37:27.679
So you're Li Qiang.

485
37:31.719 --> 37:33.000
And you're Qin Mu.

486
37:44.400 --> 37:46.320
Our men just sent word back.

487
37:46.599 --> 37:48.440
Qin Mu has already returned to Country M.

488
37:48.840 --> 37:50.079
Yesterday, a Chinese man

489
37:50.400 --> 37:51.440
went to Qin Mu's place looking for him.

490
37:52.199 --> 37:54.280
I'm guessing that was Li Qiang.

491
37:54.840 --> 37:57.199
Still no sign of Ma Jingrong, though.

492
38:02.039 --> 38:02.599
Brother Dong.

493
38:02.800 --> 38:03.320
Brother Dong.

494
38:08.639 --> 38:09.760
You were special forces?

495
38:10.199 --> 38:10.559
Yes.

496
38:14.159 --> 38:15.599
I don't keep freeloaders here.

497
38:16.000 --> 38:17.239
If you've really got what it takes,

498
38:17.559 --> 38:18.400
you can stay.

499
38:19.360 --> 38:19.960
Clouded Leopard.

500
38:20.320 --> 38:20.920
Boss.

501
38:22.559 --> 38:24.320
Clouded Leopard is my best fighter.

502
38:25.760 --> 38:27.119
If you can take him down,

503
38:29.519 --> 38:30.480
you're my brother.

504
38:30.599 --> 38:31.239
Three minutes.

505
38:32.079 --> 38:33.360
If you win,

506
38:33.639 --> 38:35.239
you can stay and work for me.

507
38:35.920 --> 38:36.880
If not,

508
38:40.760 --> 38:42.159
you don't get to stay.

509
38:45.920 --> 38:46.639
Three minutes.

510
38:47.679 --> 38:49.599
What's wrong? Scared?

511
38:50.719 --> 38:51.360
If you don't have the guts,

512
38:51.400 --> 38:53.039
stay and pay for my brother's life.

513
39:00.360 --> 39:00.960
Begin.

514
39:47.360 --> 39:47.960
Time's up.

515
40:05.440 --> 40:06.400
Looks like you lost.

516
40:09.119 --> 40:10.719
There are many ways to subdue someone.

517
40:11.159 --> 40:12.480
You don't always have to use your fists.

518
40:15.679 --> 40:18.159
Clouded Leopard, I always say

519
40:18.800 --> 40:21.079
fists can't solve everything.

520
40:21.440 --> 40:22.840
If you keep acting like this,

521
40:23.480 --> 40:24.960
you'll get yourself killed sooner or later.

522
40:28.079 --> 40:29.159
Four-Legged Snake is right.

523
40:29.519 --> 40:30.559
You're a capable man.

524
40:32.239 --> 40:33.400
Take him with you to Country M.

525
40:33.559 --> 40:36.000
Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu must both die.

526
40:44.079 --> 40:46.119
We successfully fooled Ma Jingrong this time.

527
40:46.559 --> 40:49.679
I believe Jiang Liye and Theerade

528
40:49.840 --> 40:50.960
will take the bait soon.

529
40:52.159 --> 40:53.559
Operation Thunderbolt

530
40:54.159 --> 40:56.480
can finally close in on the biggest tiger.

531
40:58.039 --> 41:00.119
Theerade's gang power in Country M

532
41:00.400 --> 41:01.840
might not match the Four Families,

533
41:02.000 --> 41:03.360
but you still need to be careful.

534
41:04.000 --> 41:05.079
Protect yourselves.

535
41:06.239 --> 41:06.800
Understood.

536
41:07.639 --> 41:09.360
Ma Jingrong completely trusts me now.

537
41:09.880 --> 41:10.960
As for Theerade,

538
41:11.840 --> 41:12.599
I introduced him

539
41:12.760 --> 41:14.039
to a major buyer like Shen Xinru.

540
41:14.360 --> 41:15.760
He can't thank me enough.

541
41:16.760 --> 41:18.679
Now we finally have the chance

542
41:18.800 --> 41:20.039
to catch this big tiger.

543
41:21.760 --> 41:23.440
Inspector Mai sent word today.

544
41:24.400 --> 41:26.039
His informant planted near Qin Mu

545
41:26.039 --> 41:26.840
has already confirmed

546
41:27.400 --> 41:30.079
that Li Qiang tracked down Qin Mu two days ago.

547
41:30.360 --> 41:32.960
If you run into Li Qiang back in Country M,

548
41:33.280 --> 41:35.519
all our efforts will go down the drain.

549
41:43.360 --> 41:45.519
We'll cross that bridge when we get to it.

550
41:47.559 --> 41:48.559
What other choice is there?

551
41:51.360 --> 41:52.280
Don't worry.

552
41:54.400 --> 41:56.639
Before coming here, I already worked out

553
41:56.800 --> 41:58.079
an action plan with Inspector Mai.

554
41:58.199 --> 41:59.519
He will coordinate with Country M's police

555
41:59.679 --> 42:01.280
under the guise of fighting illegal entry

556
42:01.679 --> 42:02.920
to launch a secret operation

557
42:03.280 --> 42:05.000
to capture Li Qiang and rescue Tian Xin.

558
42:06.360 --> 42:08.400
By the time you return to Country M,

559
42:08.599 --> 42:10.840
Li Qiang should already be extradited back.

560
42:14.199 --> 42:16.320
Once Tian Xin is saved from Li Qiang,

561
42:16.480 --> 42:17.440
the heavy burden on Li Xiao's mind

562
42:17.440 --> 42:18.320
can finally be lifted.

563
42:19.559 --> 42:22.199
I hope the two can reunite soon.

564
42:24.760 --> 42:26.079
What is Li Xiao doing right now?

565
42:26.360 --> 42:28.280
Li Xiao has located Professor Du.

566
42:28.480 --> 42:29.400
He's being held by Piyazi

567
42:29.400 --> 42:31.960
in a border town within our country.

568
42:32.079 --> 42:33.320
The police will send

569
42:33.320 --> 42:34.559
a special task force

570
42:34.719 --> 42:36.639
led by Li Xiao to rescue him.

571
42:40.159 --> 42:43.039
Operation Thunderbolt is in its final stage.

572
42:43.480 --> 42:44.679
The dawn is just ahead.

573
42:45.119 --> 42:47.280
Please give it your all, everyone.

574
42:48.519 --> 42:49.480
Yes, sir!

575
42:50.199 --> 42:52.280
Director Huang, let me give you a briefing.

576
42:52.800 --> 42:54.559
According to the Economic Crimes Division,

577
42:54.880 --> 42:57.599
many wire transfers from Longze Group

578
42:57.800 --> 42:58.960
suspected of money laundering

579
42:59.159 --> 43:01.159
were actually signed and authorized

580
43:01.400 --> 43:03.159
by Executive Chairman Jiang Shan.

581
43:03.480 --> 43:06.079
Along Longze Group's laundering chain,

582
43:06.239 --> 43:07.559
we found three companies

583
43:07.760 --> 43:09.679
registered under Jiang Shan's relatives.

584
43:11.960 --> 43:13.400
Jiangyang police have obtained

585
43:13.519 --> 43:14.440
Cheng Weimin's confession.

586
43:14.840 --> 43:16.280
According to Cheng Weimin,

587
43:16.920 --> 43:19.559
the one moving drugs via Zhongtian Logistics

588
43:19.679 --> 43:21.760
wasn't Chen Hai, but Jiang Shan.

589
43:22.159 --> 43:24.159
Chen Hai was merely a pawn used by Jiang Shan

590
43:24.320 --> 43:26.760
in the drug transit and laundering lines.

591
43:27.440 --> 43:29.320
Jiang Shan thought killing Chen Hai

592
43:29.480 --> 43:30.519
would cover up his tracks completely.

593
43:30.800 --> 43:31.760
What he didn't expect was

594
43:32.039 --> 43:33.440
that we would obtain

595
43:33.440 --> 43:34.599
ironclad evidence so quickly.

596
43:35.599 --> 43:37.199
After Hu Dong died,

597
43:37.880 --> 43:39.280
Jiang Shan's brother, Jiang Hua,

598
43:39.480 --> 43:41.039
took over as the head

599
43:41.239 --> 43:42.519
of Longze Group's security.

600
43:42.880 --> 43:43.960
Right now, this Jiang Hua

601
43:44.119 --> 43:45.920
is in frequent contact with local drug figures

602
43:46.039 --> 43:47.000
and criminal syndicates.

603
43:47.320 --> 43:48.559
He meets with them all the time.

604
43:48.960 --> 43:51.400
So we suspect Jiang Shan

605
43:51.599 --> 43:53.400
might be attempting to rebuild

606
43:53.559 --> 43:56.159
his drug distribution network in our city.

607
43:57.719 --> 43:59.360
Our suspicions about Jiang Shan

608
43:59.559 --> 44:00.800
are now backed by solid evidence.

609
44:01.360 --> 44:02.679
Let's work out an arrest plan

610
44:02.840 --> 44:05.039
to bust Jiang Shan and his men as soon as possible.

611
44:05.119 --> 44:06.239
Understood. Yes, sir.
